    ],
    "text": "PROVINCIAL COUNCILS ELECTIONS ACT No. 2 OF 1988",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      151.89,
      357.49,
      448.77,
      368.56
    ],
    "text": "Filling of a Vacancy in the Central Province Provincial Council",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.33,
      383.05,
      546.4,
      418.12
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the Secretary of the Central Province Provincial Council has informed the Election Commission under Section65(1) of the Provincial Councils Elections Act No. 2 of 1988 that a vacancy has occured in the membership of the CentralProvince Provincial Council by reason of Resignation;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.33,
      431.05,
      546.4,
      466.12
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the United National Party, the recognized political party to which the memberbelogned was required by the Election Commission under Section 65(2) of the aforesaid Act, to nominate an eligibleperson to fill such vacancy;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.33,
      479.05,
      546.34,
      502.12
    ],
    "text": "And whereas the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized Political Party, has nominated Mrs. S. S. W. Kongahage tofill such vacancy;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      54.33,
      515.05,
      546.38,
      562.12
    ],
    "text": "The Election Commission acting in terms of Section 65(2) of the Provincial Councils Elections Act, No. 2 of1988, read with the Nineteenth Amendment to the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, dohereby declare Mrs. S. S. W. Kongahage, elected as a member of the above Provincial Council from the AdministrativeDistrict of Kandy in respect of which such vacancy occured.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.33,
      575.05,
      405.94,
      586.12
    ],
    "text": "Mahinda Deshapriya-Chairman-Elections Commission",
    "fonts": [
